# Placement CRM — API Endpoints (170 Total)

> All documents (offer letters, resumes, certificates) stored as **URL links** — no file uploads.
> Bulk registration receives **JSON array** from frontend (frontend parses Excel/CSV).

---

## 🔴 Section 1: Sysadmin APIs (8 endpoints)

> **Auth**: .env credentials → JWT with role `sysadmin`

| # | Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|--------|----------|-------------|
| 1 | POST | `/api/sysadmin/login` | Sysadmin login (.env credentials) |
| 2 | POST | `/api/sysadmin/create_new_college` | Create college + first admin user (transaction) |
| 3 | GET | `/api/sysadmin/get_all_colleges` | List all colleges (filter: status, type) |
| 4 | GET | `/api/sysadmin/get_college/:collegeId` | Get single college details |
| 5 | PUT | `/api/sysadmin/update_college/:collegeId` | Update college info |
| 6 | PATCH | `/api/sysadmin/toggle_college_status/:collegeId` | Activate / Inactivate college |
| 7 | PATCH | `/api/sysadmin/update_college_features/:collegeId` | Update enabled features |
| 8 | PATCH | `/api/sysadmin/update_academic_year/:collegeId` | Update default_academic_year |

---

## 🟢 Section 2: College Admin APIs (95 endpoints)

> **Auth**: JWT from college user login → payload has `{ user_id, college_id, role }`

### Auth & Password
| # | Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|--------|----------|-------------|
| 9 | POST | `/api/college/login` | College user login |
| 10 | POST | `/api/college/forgot_password` | Send password reset email |
| 11 | POST | `/api/college/reset_password` | Reset password with token |
| 12 | POST | `/api/college/change_password` | Change own password |

### User Management (College Admin, TPO, HOD, Teacher)
| # | Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|--------|----------|-------------|
| 13 | POST | `/api/college/create_user` | Create college user |
| 14 | GET | `/api/college/get_all_users` | List users (filter: role, status) |
| 15 | GET | `/api/college/get_user/:userId` | Get single user |
| 16 | PUT | `/api/college/update_user/:userId` | Update user info |
| 17 | PATCH | `/api/college/toggle_user_status/:userId` | Activate / Inactivate user |

